#: matesla/TeslaPartner.py:121
#, python-format
msgid "Partner public key must be served over HTTPS (got %(scheme)s)."
msgstr "De openbare partnersleutel moet via HTTPS worden aangeboden (ontvangen: %(scheme)s)."

